lines=['# Generated revision 91 versus valid_synergee.mdb','','Inspected 27 October 2026 using read-only DAO extraction. Both source SHA-256 hashes remained unchanged. No saved queries, macros, modules, native SynerGEE import, or load-flow calculations were executed.','','## Findings','','The generated MDB and approved reference have identical table definitions, indexes, and relationships (50 tables and 41 relationships). They represent different transformers and surveyed networks. The generated customer and apparent-demand values are populated, but its Loads layout differs from the reference. The reference also includes a modelled PV connection.','','| Item | Generated r91 | Approved valid_synergee.mdb |','|---|---:|---:|','| Transformer ID | 11140223003 | T-8160421145 |','| Transformer type | 100 KVA | 100 KVA |','| Feeder | Internal identifier, source feeder 407 | Kot Madina |','| Substation label | 407 | 132 kv Khanewal |','| Nodes | 14 | 33 |','| Sections | 13 | 31 |','| Loads rows | 108 | 30 |','| Customers (sum across phases) | 74 | 242 |','| Demand (sum across phases) | 148 kVA | 728.60 kVA |',f'| Stored section length | {x["length_m"]:.3f} m | {y["length_m"]:.3f} m |','| Zero-length sections | 2 | 0 |','| Zero/empty customer-and-kVA load rows | 98 | 3 |','| PV connections (InstDGens) | 0 | 1 |','| PV year records (InstMymDGens) | 0 | 1 |','| Modelled PV output, Year 0 | None recorded | 5.00 kW |','| Meter points | 0 | 1 |','','## PV details','','The approved reference includes:','','- SectionId: `103331080825010`.','- DGenDesc: `PVGEN-103331080825010`.','- InstMymDGens.YearNumber: `0`.','- Phase1Kw / Phase2Kw / Phase3Kw: `1.6666666667` each (5 kW total).','- Phase kvar: zero on all three phases.','- CapacityFactor: 1; DGenOutputPct: 100; DGenVoltSet: 120.','- Its PV SectionId resolves to an existing section. InstGenerators is empty in both databases; this does not mean the reference has no PV.','','The revision 91 source JSON contains zero PV records and empty pv_details in all 24 survey rows. Therefore the generated absence is consistent with its supplied survey data. The reference PV belongs to a different transformer and must not be copied into this survey. If 11140223003 has PV, capture and verify its own PV details and configure the export generator mapping. Generator connection records do not establish individual metered PV customer counts.','','Demand is expressed in kVA and generation in kW. Subtracting 5 kW directly from 728.6 kVA would not establish net apparent demand.','','## Loads and allocation','','The application writes nine consumer-category rows per survey section: 12 sections x 9 categories = 108 Loads rows. Only 10 have nonzero customers/demand; 98 are zero. The reference has one Loads row on each of 30 sections, including three zero/empty rows. Loads.SectionId has non-unique indexes in both files, so this layout is permitted by the database schema; native SynerGEE import must still be checked to confirm that repeated section rows are summed and not overwritten.','','Generated 74 customers and 148 kVA match the revision 91 source JSON: 36 RS customers contribute 72 kVA, and 38 SC customers contribute 76 kVA. kW/kvar are NULL in the generated file under the direct-kVA method; the reference stores zero kW/kvar. Neither representation should be described as measured real/reactive power.','','| Phase | Generated customers | Generated kVA | Reference customers | Reference kVA |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
