lines+=['','Generated allocation keeps customer counts as whole numbers. The reference includes fractional per-phase customer allocation. Different totals are expected for different surveys and should not be forced to match.','','## Network checks','',f'- Missing section endpoints: generated {x["bad_endpoints"]}; reference {y["bad_endpoints"]}.',f'- Orphan load rows: generated {x["orphan_loads"]}; reference {y["orphan_loads"]}.',f'- Orphan PV references: generated {x["orphan_pv"]}; reference {y["orphan_pv"]}.',f'- Nodes reachable from the feeder with undirected edges: generated {x["reachable_undirected"]}/14; reference {y["reachable_undirected"]}/33.',f'- Nodes reachable following FromNodeId to ToNodeId: generated {x["reachable_directed"]}/14; reference {y["reachable_directed"]}/33.','- Generated has two zero-length links: the logical transformer terminal link and the first S/E pair, whose endpoints share the source coordinate under the current first-pair policy. If that pair represents a physical span, confirm its length.','- The generated first survey edge points toward the root. This is an orientation-review finding; all generated nodes are connected when ignoring edge direction.','','## Matching electrical settings requiring independent confirmation','','Both store Frequency 60, nominal feeder voltage 11 kV, BusVoltageLevel 11.37, SpecNomKv 4.16, NomKvMode C, YG/YG transformer connections, and UseInstanceImpedance 0. Both use metric length units, WGS 1984 UTM Zone 43N, SynerGEE Electric 5.0.0.324, and the line configuration 12.5/7.2 kV cross arm C2-2.','','The generated JSON has secondary_voltage_kv unset, retaining SpecNomKv 4.16 from mapping values. Confirm these values and library entries against the department requirements for this transformer. Agreement with an approved file for a different transformer is not independent verification.','','The estimated demand/nameplate ratios are 148% and 728.6%, respectively. They compare connected model inputs to the type label and do not establish measured simultaneous loading or a load-flow overload.','','## Meter and other differences','','The reference meter point is linked to SectionId 103338160421145.2, with its measurement fields unset. Generated meter-point tables are empty. The reference also has year labels and descriptive/optional text fields that are unset in the generated file.','','## Record count inventory','','| Table | Generated | Reference |','|---|---:|---:|']
